  "posts": [
    {
      "post_id": "post_001",
      "content": "What an amazing day at the beachfront gathering! The kids had so much fun building sandcastles and enjoying the sunshine. Truly a day to remember!"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "post_002",
      "content": "A big thank you to everyone who joined us for the community beachfront gathering. The energy and joy were contagious, and it was wonderful to see families coming together to celebrate our beautiful beach."
    },
